          <p class="section-header-desc">{% if zh %}以下為 Harry 在 ABC Design 期間所設計的品牌視覺素材，涵蓋產品圖形、社群貼文、以及行銷物料。{% else %}
            Brand visual materials designed by Harry at ABC Design, covering product graphics, social media posts, and
